{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "woman-in-the-dunes",
  "chunk_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-chunk-0439",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00439",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "但是，等一等……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "But wait a moment...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00439",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "如果女人出去过了……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "If the woman had been outside...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00439",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "没有绳梯是无法想像的。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It was impossible to imagine it without a rope ladder.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00439",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "不知道到底用了什么方法，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He did not know exactly what method she had used,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00439",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "但至少可以肯定，她用过绳梯……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "but at least it was certain that she had used the rope ladder...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00439",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "他浅浅地做一推算，该有这么回事吧……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He made a rough calculation; something like that must have happened...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00439",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "一个只盘算逃跑的犯人姑且不说，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Leaving aside a prisoner who thought only of escape,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00439",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "而那女人是村里的居民，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "that woman was a resident of the village,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00439",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "要是被剥夺了自由，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and if her freedom were taken away,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00439",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "她才不会忍气吞声呢……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "she would never just suffer in silence...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00439",
      "unit_index": 11,
      "source_text": "撤去绳梯，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Removing the rope ladder",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00439",
      "unit_index": 12,
      "source_text": "看来只不过是为了关闭生人而采取的临时措施……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "seemed to be nothing more than a temporary measure for shutting in outsiders...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00439",
      "unit_index": 13,
      "source_text": "要真是的话，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "If that was really the case,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00439",
      "unit_index": 14,
      "source_text": "就这样保持现状，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "then by keeping things as they were,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00439",
      "unit_index": 15,
      "source_text": "让她放松警惕，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and letting her lower her guard,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00439",
      "unit_index": 16,
      "source_text": "或许什么时候又能撞上同样的机会呢……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "perhaps someday he might come across the same chance again...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
